        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sentinelese\n- Places: North Sentinel Island, Andaman and Nicobar Islands, Andaman Islands, South Sentinel Island, Bay of Bengal, India\n- Languages: Sentinelese language, Andamanese languages\n- Concepts: uncontacted peoples, language classification\n\nFacts:\n- North Sentinel Island is one of the Andaman Islands in the Bay of Bengal, and the Andaman Islands include South Sentinel Island.\n- The Sentinelese people live on North Sentinel Island in the Andaman and Nicobar Islands of India.\n- Sentinelese is the presumed language of the Sentinelese people.\n- The Sentinelese language is currently unclassifiable because it is spoken by an uncontacted people.",
